"P3214743381" "After his defeat, Aeoch told you what you wanted to know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2986803411" "You defeated Aeoch and clobbered his cronies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2703944285" "I don't like to take the word of a criminal cultist at face value, but this is still a lead, {HeroName}. We know the Council are interested in us, and they are at the top of the list of suspects. Aeoch's visitor might know something. I'll see if I can confirm any of this information before you go in. I don't want to lose any more people."
// RandomFameString :
"P2181963170" "Something has the Peacekeepers riled up. I wonder what's going on with them?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_Peacebringer_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3613290517" "I've checked Aeoch's information out with some of my contacts and while no one can confirm it, the location he gave does look like it might be a Council base. I'm reluctant to ask you to investigate, but it's the only lead we have. I don't know what you might find in there, but right now the only option to find our missing fellow Peacebringers is to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>take out that Council base and search it for information.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2216404002" "Take out the Council base and search it for information"
// SendOffString :
"P3763103926" "You will need to take out all the Council troops in the base and check its computer system for any clues. Be careful, though. Something about all of this still feels wrong to me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2537986683" "Defeat all Council in Base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2738072327" "Remember, not only do you need to secure that base, but also check it's computer system. There may be additional clues there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P387015326" "You don't know what secrets this council base may hide, but you can't shake the feeling that you won't like what you find."

