// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2613016846" "Lightburner had some words for you after the battle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2260616879" "Lillian Issan"
// Description :
"P1873859424" "Find Lillian"
// InteractBeginString :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3490834688" "Thanks, {Rescuer}, I needed the help. I'll be sure to get your name right in the story."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3217261663" "You defeated Lightburner and rescue Shadowstar's daughter Lillian from the Vahzilok."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3673367702" "Shadowstar's daughter Lillian is safe, and now we have 3 of the 5 rogues, all thanks to your efforts. That only leaves 2, Fullalbedo and Brightshift. These were our people before they became fanatics, but that doesn't excuse their actions. They have to be stopped before they can make an attack on Shadowstar. "
// RandomFameString :
"P2584880796" "Did you see Lillian Issan's piece on the Vahzilok? She's sure lucky {HeroName} was there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_Peacebringer_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2785317955" "We've been able to piece together the location of the last 2 renegades. They're at a Council base, waiting for a shipment of Quantum Array guns. They plan to use them to ambush Shadowstar. Initially they were planning to draw her in using Lillian, but thanks to you that plan's not going to happen. This gives us the opportunity we need. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We can put a stop to the Renegades' plans if we strike them now, but it won't be easy.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P251390401" "Recapture the remaining Kheldian Renegades"
// SendOffString :
"P718709739" "Your main goal is to capture Fullalbedo and Brightshift, but they are sure to have a full contingent of Council troops there to aid them. There may also be some Quantum array guns that have been shipped in. Capture any of those you can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P647507291" "Capture the Renegades"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P454366339" "The depths of this Council base hides the last two renegades."

